  "question": {
    "text": "If the value of the integral <math><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math> is equal to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "6.25",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mfrac><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math><br />So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mfrac><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfrac><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfrac><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math><br />Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>25</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>25</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>25</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn></math></p>"
  }
